# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
# Fitness Studio Management System - Environment Configuration
# ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

# DATABASE CONFIGURATION
# ─────────────────────
# Local development (SQLite):
DATABASE_URL=sqlite:///./fitness_studio.db

# PostgreSQL (production recommended):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://username:password@localhost:5432/fitness_studio

# For Railway/Cloud hosting:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/db


# SECURITY
# ────────
# Change this to a strong random string in production
SECRET_KEY=dev-secret-key-change-in-production


# EMAIL CONFIGURATION (Gmail SMTP)
# ─────────────────────────────────
# Gmail account to send reminders from:
MAIL_USERNAME=your-gym-account@gmail.com

# Gmail App Password (NOT your regular Gmail password!)
# See: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
MAIL_PASSWORD=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx

# Email sender details:
MAIL_FROM=your-gym-account@gmail.com
MAIL_FROM_NAME=סטודיו כושר

# SMTP Server (Gmail):
MAIL_SERVER=smtp.gmail.com
MAIL_PORT=587

# Email reminders sent daily at 20:00 (Israel time) for next day's sessions


# FRONTEND URL (for CORS)
# ──────────────────────
# Development:
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:4200

# Production:
# FRONTEND_URL=https://your-domain.com
